varies about ±21% over two days. So the best order is roughly 1.15–1.2× the forecast. That favours plans 7, 6 and 4.\n- **Item 1:** a missing unit costs 11 (6 + 5) and an extra unit costs up to 12. The best order is about 1.05–1.1× the forecast. Plan 6 orders too much of item 1, and plan 7 slightly too little.\n- **Plans 0 and 2** order at or below the forecast, while average demand runs above it. Their shortage penalties outweigh the purchases they save, so they are the most likely to finish in the bottom half.\n- **What every plan shares:** at the start, item 1 runs short on days 2–4 in every plan, because the first order arrives on day 5. Storage capacity of 284 is not a real limit for any plan.\n\n**Ranking:** 4, 7, 5 and 6 are most likely in the top half. Plans 3 and 1 are uncertain: 3 because of its short carry-over and holding costs, 1 because of its fees. Plans 0 and 2 are lowest."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4928, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4928}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T09:16:30.477Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWGvDoNKCJC8Yzy5oRkd"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01ThEMVrpAQHYHEdpA89eNHW", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWGvE5ETS9GaGUCZKsde", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_